{"kind":"propose","text":"Adopt the exact current landing-obligation design artifact as the governing implementation plan for target-aware work delivery. This preserves the ratified replacement direction in proposal 5a79613e: every implementation request names or inherits its target repository, branch ref and measured head; main is only a legacy default; a hold is temporary state owned by a named releaser; ordinary reports cannot discharge a landing; exact receipts or explicit carried/abandoned succession are the terminals; and approved-not-landed remains visible relative to the named target. Authorize only the staged I1-I6 and W1 requests in section 11, with their stated dependencies, architecture duties, mutation-sensitive tests, exact-head review, target-aware landing, CI and cleanup. The note remains independent of Tailapps/JSONata and adds no merge-mode terminal.","body":{"stale_bases":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:5a79613e580bf07d079835ea44d025f74c7d5ff1 stale; retired bases: git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:0e74c3f618a3083014fbbf48216f0bfb3a3d35ea, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:2900f4964542bc5a1b80744393098af222890291, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:991e53132b819b1a0c90b8eb04c3f40630863279"}}